 "notes": "Full title:\ngood kid, m.A.A.d city a short film by Kendrick Lamar\n\nm.A.A.d is an acronym for both \"My Angry Adolescence Divided\" and \"My Angel's On Angel Dust\"\n\nFirst US pressing. Released in a gatefold sleeve.\n\nSticker on shrink wrap around the gatefold sleeve states:\nKendrick Lamar\ngood kid, m.A.A.d city\nFeaturing The Hits\n\"Swimming Pool (Drank)\"\n\"The Recipe\" ft Dr. Dre\n& \"Poetic Justice\" ft Drake\nDeluxe Edition\nIncludes 3 Bonus Songs\nB0017536-02 [sic]\n\nD2 to D4 are marked with \"[Bonus Track]\"\nB1 mistakenly lists \"Victoria Garance Alixe Legrand\" as two separate writers\n\nManufactured and distributed in the United States by […].\n℗ & © 2012 Aftermath/Interscope Records\n\nA1: Recorded at Patchwerk Recording Studios, Atlanta, GA and TDE Red Room, Carson, CA\nA2, A3, A4, B1, B2, B3, B4, C1, C2, D3: Recorded at TDE Red Room, Carson CA\nC3: Recorded at At My Mama's House Studio, Los Angeles, CA, TDE Red Room, Carson, CA\nD1, D2: Recorded at Encore Studios, Burbank, CA and TDE Red Room Studios, Carson, CA\nD4: Recorded at TDE Red Room, Carson, CA and Body Music Studios, Miami, FL \n\nAll tracks: Mixed at: No Excuses Studios\n\nA1: Produced […] for Tha Bizness Productions LLC\nA2: Produced […] for TDE Music. Live string arrangement composed and performed […] in Brooklyn, NY\nA3: Produced […] for Hitboy Music/Very Good Beats Inc.\nB3: Produced […] for The Neptunes\nB4: Produced […] for TDE Music and THC\nD1: Produced […] for F.O.B. Entertainment/N.Q.C. Management LLC\n\nB1: Jay Rock appears courtesy of Top Dawg Entertainment/Strange Music\nB2: Drake appears courtesy of Aspire Music Group/Young Money Entertainment/Cash Money Records\nD1, D2: Dr. Dre appears courtesy of Aftermath Records\nD4: Mary J. Blige appears courtesy of Matriarch Entertainment/Geffen Records\n\n• A2: Contains portions of \"Tiden Flyver\" (Braun/Vindahl Friis/Lykke Schmidt) published by EMI Blackwood Music Inc./Edition MFD Publishing/EMI Music Publishing Denmark A/S(BMI) and Publishing Designee of Liv Lykke.\nContains elements of the master recording \"Tiden Flyver\" performed by Boom Clap Bachelors. Licensed Courtesy Music For Dreams, Denmark.\n• B1: Contains elements of \"Silver Soul\" Words and Music by Victoria Garance, Alixe Legrand and Alex Scally ©2010 Chrysalis Music (ASCAP)\nAll Rights Administered by Chrysalis Music Group Inc., a BMG Chrysalis company.\nContains a sample of \"Silver Soul\" as performed by Beach House. Courtesy of Sub Pop Records.\n• B2: Contains excerpts from \"Any Time Any Place\" written by J. Harris, J. Jackson, T. Lewis and published by EMI April Music, Inc. (ASCAP), Flyte Tyme Tunes, Inc. (ASCAP), Black Ice Publishing (BMI).\nContains excerpts from \"Any Time Any Place\" as performed by Janet Jackson. Used courtesy of Virgin UK, under license from EMI Music Marketing.\n• C2: Contains elements of \"Maybe Tomorrow\" (Q. Jones/A. Bergman/M. Bergman), WB Music Corp. (ASCAP). \nContains a sample of \"Maybe Tomorrow\" as performed by Grant Green courtesy of Blue Note Records.\n• D1: \"Compton\" contains excerpts from \"What's This World Coming To\" as performed by Formula IV, courtesy of Sony Music Entertainment.\n• D2: Contains elements of \"Meet The Frownies\" written by E. Cardona, G. D'Amico, U. Gupta, A. Hernandez, B. Ujueta and published by Domino Publishing Company of America Inc.(BMI)\nThis track contains a sample of \"Meet The Frownies\" As performed by Twin Sister. Courtesy of Dead Oceans.\n\n• A1: WB Music Corp., TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) West Coast Livin Publishing(ASCAP) Henderworks Music Publishing (BMI)\n• A2: WB Music Corp., TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) TDE Music, Beat Bully Productions (ASCAP) EMI Blackwood Music Inc./Edition MFD Publishing/EMI Music Publishing Denmark A/S(BMI) Publishing Designee of Liv Lykke\n• A3: WB Music Corp.,TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) Hit-Boy Music, U Can't Teach Bein' The Shhh/Songs of Universal (BMI)\n• A4: WB Music Corp., TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) EMI Music Publishing Scandinavia\n• B1: WB Music Corp., TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) SESAC affiliate DAHI PRODUCTIONS - writers number 379845 (SESAC) TDE Music (BMI) Chrysalis Music (ASCAP)\n• B2: WB Music Corp., TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) Elijah Molina Publishing, Kobalt (SESAC) Live Write LLC / EMI Blackwood Music, Inc. (BMI) EMI April Music, Inc.(ASCAP) Flyte Tyme Tunes, Inc (ASCAP) Black Ice Publishing (BMI)\n• B3: WB Music Corp.,TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) EMI April Music Inc. o/b/o Itself and More Water from Nazareth (ASCAP)\n• B4: WB Music Corp.,TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) TDE Music, Beat Bully Productions (ASCAP)THC Music (ASCAP) Bluestamp Tunes (BMI)\n• C1: WB Music Corp., TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) Warner-Tamerlane Publishing Corp., Brother Bagz Publishing(BMI)\n• C2: WB Music Corp., TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) Its Like That (ASCAP) Derrick Hutchins Jr. Publishing (BMI) WB Music Corp.(ASCAP)\n• C3: WB Music Corp., TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) Rose Mac Music (ASCAP)\n• D1: WB Music Corp.,TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) N.Q.C. Music Publishing LLC o/b/o F.O.B. Music Publishing(ASCAP) Music City Associates (BMI) Feedmybabeez Publishing/Almo Music Corp (ASCAP)\n• D2: WB Music Corp., TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) WB Music Corp., Ain't Nothing Going on but F***n Music (ASCAP) Elijah Molina Publishing, Kobalt (SESAC) Domino Publishing Company of America Inc.(BMI)\n• D3: WB Music Corp., TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP) Pizza Publishing (ASCAP) WB Music Corp., Hard Working Black Folks Publishing, Psalms 144:1(BMI)\n• D4: WB Music Corp., TDE Music, Hard Working Black Folks Publishing (ASCAP)Jacks Love Em